{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03993","headline":"三月三日宴王明府山亭 · 高瑾","name":"三月三日宴王明府山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮春元巳，春服初裁。\n童冠八九，于洛之隈。\n河堤草变，巩树花开。\n逸人谈发，仙御舟来。\n间关黄鸟，瀺灂丹腮。\n乐饮命席，优哉悠哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高瑾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}